kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "execution-compute-rowwise-fusion"
purpose: "在 compute 段对满足约束的派生字段做 row-wise / 同依赖复用融合，降低 N×M 框架税；保持值语义与每字段每行计算器调用次数；安全外壳外回退 field-major。 [c20-compute-expr-rowwise-fusion]"
valid_scope[1]: src/scalim/
requirements[8]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r960,"Row-wise fusion groups are auto-selected","系统 MUST 在同一 compute segment（pre-ref 或 post-ref）内自动识别 fusion group，且 MUST NOT 引入新的 YAML/`call_groups` 开关。字段进入同一 group 当且仅当同时满足：(1) 成员为 `compute_expr` 或无 `$ctx`/`ctx_attr` 的 `call_by`；(2) 组内字段互不依赖；(3) 组内依赖集合完全相同（Q1）；(4) 通过本 spec 安全外壳。不确定时 MUST NOT 融合（回退 field-major）。"
  r961,"Safety shell disables fusion","当任一条件成立时，系统 MUST 对该 segment / 候选组禁用融合并回退 field-major：`compute_mode`/`guardrails` 为 `fast_fail`；instrumentation `wants(FIELD_COMPUTE)` 或 `wants(OPERATOR_SPAN)`；sink 为列式（`IColumnSink` 或等价，Q2-B）；组内任一字段的实验性 `call_by` memo 对该字段生效（Q2b）。含 `$ctx`（`call_ctx_key`）或 `is_constant_compute` 的字段 MUST NOT 进入 fusion group。"
  r962,"Row sinks may fuse including streaming","对行 sink（含 streaming 与非流式行写出），系统 MAY 在安全外壳内启用融合。对列 sink，系统 MUST NOT 融合（Q2-B）。"
  r963,"Fusion preserves values and call counts","融合路径 MUST 保持目标字段值与 field-major 路径一致。对组内每个 `(field, row)`，计算器/`compute_expr` 求值次数 MUST 等于 field-major（`calc_calls == N×M`，Q3）；系统 MUST NOT 将多个不同 calculator 隐式合并为一次调用。"
  r964,"Fusion memory stays bounded","融合路径的额外缓冲 MUST 与字段数/组大小/可选固定 tile 相关；峰值 RSS 相对 field-major MUST 满足变更门槛（≤ +10%）。系统 MUST NOT 引入按总行数线性且跨批存活的融合缓存。"
  r965,"Fusion observability is optional and low-tax","系统 MAY 记录融合诊断（如 `fused_group_size` / `disabled_reason`，含 `memo` / `column_sink` / `ctx` / `fast_fail` / `wants_events`）。未启用诊断时 MUST NOT 因融合引入可观测税。融合 MUST NOT 改变未订阅时的对外事件契约；当 `wants(FIELD_COMPUTE|OPERATOR_SPAN)` 时 MUST 禁用融合（见 r961）。"
  r966,"Fusion only applies to early compute segment fields","row-wise fusion MUST 仅作用于仍在 compute 算子段求值的字段集合。write-precompute（late）字段的行内 deps 复用 MUST 由 write-precompute 路径负责，MUST NOT 在本能力中重复实现第二套行内融合引擎。"
  r967,"Hotpath default-on aligns with fusion shell","在 `execution-hotpath-fastpaths` 默认开启前提下，本能力的默认行为 MUST 与安全外壳一致：外壳内可融合；外壳外 ≡ field-major。"
scenarios[21]{req_id,id,given,when,then,feature}:
  r960,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r960,"identical-deps-form-one-group",同一 segment 内多个无 ctx `call_by` 字段依赖集合完全相同且互不依赖,规划/执行识别 fusion group,这些字段 MUST 被允许进入同一 fusion group,true
  r960,"overlapping-but-unequal-deps-not-fused",两字段依赖集合有重叠但不完全相同,识别 fusion group,系统 MUST NOT 将二者融为同一组（第一期 Q1）,true
  r961,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r961,"fast-fail-disables-fusion",`fast_fail` 开启且存在本可融合的候选组,执行 compute 段,系统 MUST 回退 field-major（不融合）,true
  r961,"field-compute-wants-disables-fusion",instrumentation wants `FIELD_COMPUTE`,执行 compute 段,系统 MUST 不融合,true
  r961,"ctx-call-by-excluded-from-group",某字段 `call_by` 需要 `$ctx`,识别 fusion 候选,该字段 MUST NOT 进入 group,true
  r961,"memo-enabled-field-disables-whole-group",组内一字段 EXP call_by memo 生效,识别/执行融合,整组 MUST 禁用融合,true
  r962,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r962,"row-streaming-may-fuse",行 streaming sink 且安全外壳允许,执行,系统 MAY 融合且写出值 MUST 与 field-major 一致,true
  r962,"column-sink-never-fuses",列 sink 且存在同 deps 候选,执行,系统 MUST NOT 融合,true
  r963,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r963,"calc-calls-equal-n-times-m",N 行 × M 个同 deps 薄 `call_by`,融合路径与 field-major 对拍,两边 `calc_calls` MUST 均为 N×M 且值一致,true
  r964,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r964,"no-cross-batch-fusion-row-cache","",在多 batch 行路径上启用融合,系统 MUST NOT 保留跨 batch 的按行融合缓存,true
  r965,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r965,"disabled-reason-may-be-logged",融合因 `column_sink` 或 `memo` 禁用且诊断开启,执行,系统 MAY 暴露对应 `disabled_reason`,true
  r966,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r966,"late-fields-not-double-fused",字段属于 write-precompute `late_fields`,执行,该字段 MUST 不由本 row-wise fusion 引擎在 late 路径再次融合调度,true
  r967,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r967,"shell-off-equals-field-major",安全外壳关闭融合,执行,行为 MUST 等价于既有 field-major fastpath,true
